# Paths that make up the Connector contract (ADR 0073): the SDK, the canonical
# tracker/forge/event types, the Host calls, and the conformance kits and
# checks that pin them. A diff touching any of them makes
# `ci-changes.sh --connectors` select every first-party Connector, not only the
# ones the diff names. One bash glob per line; `*` crosses `/`. Only `*` is a
# wildcard (nix/checks/default.nix enforces it).
# The suite's Nix inputs are listed too: `core/*` and agent-dispatch.yml are
# reached via lib/connector-checks.nix and a backend row's goTestRepoFiles.
sdk/*
core/*
cmd/launcher/internal/connectorhost/*
cmd/launcher/internal/connectortracker/*
cmd/launcher/internal/connectorforge/*
cmd/launcher/internal/driver/driverkit/*
cmd/launcher/internal/dispatchkind/*
cmd/launcher/internal/hostop/*
cmd/launcher/internal/forge/forgetest/*
lib/connector-checks.nix
lib/build-constants.nix
lib/backends/*
lib/jira-status-mapping.nix
nix/checks/go-check-env.nix
nix/connector-wasm.nix
nix/fixtures/connector/*
nix/fixtures/connector-wasm/*
.github/workflows/agent-dispatch.yml
